        "slug": "b1-shopping-decisions-too-enough",
        "title": "too / enough",
        "rule_summary": "Use too + adjective for more than acceptable and adjective + enough for a sufficient degree.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای بیشتر از حد مناسب از too + صفت و برای حد کافی از adjective + enough استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "It's too heavy to carry every day.",
            "fa": "برای حمل روزانه زیادی سنگینه."
          },
          {
            "en": "The screen is bright enough outside.",
            "fa": "صفحه بیرون به‌اندازه کافی روشنه."
